{
  "sourcePatchId": "f7bea6b9-0b89-5793-a74c-34cf1d056847",
  "name": "Ambient Rounded Sub",
  "description": "Sine/triangle sub-bass with soft saturation, low-pass tone and optional amplitude pulse. Suggested MIDI 24\u201355. Polyphonic, dry and centered. Velocity-sensitive. Performance controls apply to new notes; MIDI controls affect held notes and releases. Control channel defaults to 16 (independent of note channel). CC24 Body, CC25 Tone (Hz), CC26 Warmth, CC27 Pulse Depth, CC28 Pulse Rate (Hz). CC0 preserves the base setting; higher values add intensity, with 30 ms smoothing. Use controller-sequencer Reset Value 0. Notes never reset CCs; instances sharing a control channel share automation. Route Stereo Output through the mixer to Master.",
  "isTemplate": false,
  "alwaysOn": false,
  "instrumentType": "bass",
